window.products.push({"id":298042,"name":"YOUNIS Dresser Organizer Cabinet Drawer Storage with 4 Drawers, Sturdy Steel Frame Storage Shelves, Wood Top Closet Storage, Easy Pull Fabric Bins - O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fF+6-qJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Drawers are a great way to keep things big and small stored, organized and out of sight. Choose YOUNIS storage drawers. Say goodbye to the messy life! What this storage drawer can do for you? 1. Keep control of clutter. 2. Lead to an Organized lifestyle. 3. Create a spacious, tidy home. 4. It must be a smart solution to own a storage cabinet if you have tired of looking around for objects with hurried in a messy room. 5. Saving space in your room to make the most of the drawers of the dresser. Putting in anywhere you need to, it’s a good purchase to teach your kids to manage their items. 6. Everything seems to be easier with an organized way and more possibility to create a relaxation way to organize your life. Features: 1. Made of the high-quality metal frame structure, non-woven materials fabric drawer, Eco-friendly MDF top, durable and adorable. Ensuring years of use. 2. The storage drawers stand boasts a slim, lightweight design to easily fit into smaller spaces while still providing plenty of storage space. 3. Ideal for storing folded clothes, underwear, and even your daily necessities such as cosmetics and skincare products, or anything you want. 4. This chest of drawers is suitable for homes, offices, dormitories and many other places. Diversify color matching all home decoration style, fashion, and simple design help save a lot of space. 5. Easy to Assemble, no extra tools required, package includes complete dresser drawer accessories and assembling tools. Specification: Product Dimension: 22.8\" x 11.4\" x 30.9\" / 58 x 29 x 78.5 CM Material: Iron Frame + Fabric + MDF Board + Cardboard + Wood Handle What's in the Box? - Drawer Storage Dresser - Assembling Tool Kit - Instructions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fF+6-qJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOUNIS","source_asin":"B07V4SGKJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V4SGKJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V4SGKJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":298043,"name":"Mundial 5100 Series 6\" Chef's Knife, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21Z3Z8MSK2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Smaller chef's knives are the newest trend in gourmet cutlery. This 6-inch blade is perfect for slicing, dicing and chopping all medium sized foods. Red is hot. Red is energizing. Studies have even shown that exposure to red quickens the pulse and increases the appetite. No wonder red continues to be increasingly prevalent in home fashion ¿ especially in the kitchen! Mundial's 5100 Series Red adds a burst of color and contemporary style to a classic assortment of premium fully forged cutlery. A chef's true individual style will come through with the 5100 Series Red - a bright new look in high-performance gourmet cutlery. Fully forged from high-carbon stainless steel, this premium cutlery collection features traditional three-riveted red polyacetal handles. The Value of a Fully Forged Knife Mundial knives, with very few exceptions, are fully forged in a manufacturing process that combines innovative technology with Old World tradition and expertise. In the forging process, steel is heated to an extremely high temperature, set into a die and hammered into the shape of the basic blade. Following a process of heating and cooling, the forged blade is ground to create a full taper to the cutting edge. The result is a stronger, thicker, more resilient blade that flares smoothly at the heel to blend into the shape of the handle. Cutlery that is fully forged offers an array of key benefits including greater tensile strength, increased durability, lasting sharpness, and better balance and control.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21Z3Z8MSK2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mundial","source_asin":"B000FTZDS0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FTZDS0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FTZDS0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
