window.products.push({"id":298169,"name":"2 Slice Toaster with LED Display, 2 Slice Toasters Best Rated Prime, Heating Rack, 1.6\" Wide Slot, Reheat/ Defrost/ Bagel/ Cancel, 6 Optional Browning","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LBs7Cc1AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Toaster 2 slice with LED display】: You can clearly know when the bread is almost finished through the electronic display without waiting all the time. This toaster 2 slice is made of high-quality durable stainless steel, food-grade safe, has no peculiar smell, and can withstand long-term toasting without deformation. 【Extra-wide toasting slots, built-in heating rack】: There are two 1.6\" wide slots to fit various breakfast favorites such as Texas toast, muffins, bagels, etc. Or sometimes larger breads, such as artisanal bread. In addition, just push down the back lift lever, the heating rack will pop up for you to heat any croissants, donuts and cake rolls conveniently. 【Multifunctional toaster 2 slice】: The 4 functions of reheat, defrost, bagel and cancel can meet your daily toast needs. The defrost function allows you to defrost and toast frozen bread without losing its freshness and gaining crispness. The reheat function lets you to reheat the previously toasted breads in 30s to restore its crunchy texture. Note: Both the reheat and defrost functions support 2-sided toasting bread, but the bagel option only heats one side of the bread. 【6 Optional browning dials】: 6 adjustable toasting levels to choose the perfect color and shade for your bread: from light to dark, from crisp to very crisp. 1. Dry Out the bread 2. just a Little Light Browning Setting 3. Golden Browning Setting 4. Deep Lighter Browning Setting 5. Dark Browning Setting 6. Deep Darker Browning Setting. This 2 slice toasters best rated prime can satisfy all preferences and tastes of your family. 【Easy to store and clean】: The stainless steel toaster has a slide-out crumb tray for collecting bread crumbs, just pull it out and clean the crumbs immediately. The compact design of 9.8 inches* 6.4 inches* 7 inches, with a built-in power cable storage device at the bottom, which fits well on your kitchen countertop without occupying too much space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LBs7Cc1AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nouno","source_asin":"B09H3733NT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H3733NT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H3733NT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
