window.products.push({"id":298204,"name":"Winthome 2Pack Beach Towel Microfiber，40”x 70” Swirl & Geometrical Oversized Beach Blanket with Travel Bag Quick Dry Sand Free Lightweight Large Trave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l-z5TJj-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👓 2PACK Inside: Abstract & Bandhnu Pattern, Two different patterns of beach towels perfectly match, making you and your partner look more special. 👓 SUPERIOR SKIN-FRIENDLY: Winthome microfiber beach bath towels is a great choice for anyone seeking a luxurious and comfortable experience. It made of 80% polyester and 20% nylon, which creating a luxurious and comfortable feeling against the skin. 👓 Are you in search of quick-drying beach towels? Look no further than ours! It offers superior comfort and moisture control to help your body wick away moisture for a more comfortable and enjoyable beach experience 👓 ALWAYS SAND-FREE: Ideal for beachgoers who don't want to bring sand home with them. Winthome beach towels with sand-repellent properties that prevent sand from sticking to their surface; The fiber and weaving technique allow them to easily shake off. 👓 JUST SAY GO: Winthome provides you with the admire beach towels with travel bag for a day at the beach. Don't settle for ordinary beach towels, indulge in our luxurious and quick-drying beach towels. Experience the ultimate beach luxury!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l-z5TJj-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winthome","source_asin":"B0BXX8CDLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXX8CDLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXX8CDLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":298205,"name":"Dried Grasses for Decor. Dried Pampas Grass. Fluffy Type. (3 pcs) pompous Grass. Pampas Grass Tall 48''. Pompas Floral (4Ft). Boho Decor. 3 Pompas Gra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WIog50YDS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PAMPAS GRASS LARGE Beautiful naturally dried pampas and harvested plumes which have a very long shelf life when used as décor because, well.... They are naturally dried. Pampas floral!No dyes or artificial preservatives have been used and being REAL natural products  each piece is unique and has its own characteristics. Large Pampas Grass is an incredibly stunning feature on your kitchen table, styled in your entryway, or simply in a minimalist vase in any corner of your home. Featured in vases lining aisles, gracefully draped over arches, or delicately utilized in bridal bouquets, large pampas grass is increasingly becoming a staple in weddings across the world. Our pampas grass tall is sure to be the talking point of your dinner party or wedding These are high quality, luxe pampas grass decor. Not the smaller, cheaper versions. They make perfect living room decor, boho decor, rustic decor, wedding arches, wedding bouquets, and white decor. We do our best to source the best fall floral stems we can find. Some of the benefits include: ✅ Extra Large Pampous; Fluffy ✅ Low Maintenance - No Water Needed✅ On Trend Boho Home Decor✅ No Shedding - Can Last Up to 3 Years✅ Care Guide Included✅ Approximately 46\" Tall PLEASE NOTE: — Size, color, shape and fluffiness of each plume of pampas floreal may vary.— The pampas plumes will be compressed during shipping. Please follow included instructions on fluffing them back up. They will be 4x bigger if you follow this instruction. — The pampas floral should not be placed in a vase with water.— Be gentle when opening the package. We recommend opening up the whole package before taking out the grass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WIog50YDS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AlobyC","source_asin":"B099MFZVCV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099MFZVCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099MFZVCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
