window.products.push({"id":298401,"name":"Garden of Eden Laminated Blacklight Poster - 23.5\" x 35.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uxi5uiilL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Garden of Eden Laminated Blacklight Poster , 23 inches x 35 inches, standard size poster laminated giving it a .25\" laminate border. Go back to the beginning of time with this Garden of Eden Blacklight Poster. The image shows a couple standing on a mountaintop arms raised in rejoice over their surroundings of a forest, mountains, waterfalls and the glorious sun.Printed in the USA with highly fluorescent inks and black flocking. Blacklight posters make great decoration for bedrooms, college dorm rooms, parties, entertainment rooms, or wherever you need a splash of color or glow.A flocked poster has black fibers that feel felt-like. The black appears much darker than an ink with no glare and gives great contrast to the fluorescent UV reactive inks. The poster print has a 3/4 inch (1.9 cm white border around the whole poster, which is normal for screen printed blacklight posters. The posters get pulled through the printing press by this border and the area cannot be printed.Blacklight not included and is required to see the poster fluoresce or glow in the dark. Image under blacklight is for reference only, results may vary depending on type of blacklight (ultraviolet fixture or bulb) used. Lamination may cause a glare that is not normally seen on blacklight posters depending on type of blacklight and how it is aimed at the poster. The lamination protects the poster from tears, dirt, dust, and moisture as well as keeping the flocking intact for many years of enjoyment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uxi5uiilL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scorpio Posters","source_asin":"B07X1LB9RD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X1LB9RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X1LB9RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":298402,"name":"4 Pack 8oz Soy Emergency Soy Candle 60 Hours Plus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oE7gFclNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"4 Pack of 8oz Soy Emergency Candles. These are 100% Pure Soy wax with 100% cotton wicks and lead free. These Soy Emergency Candles have a burn time of 60 Hours Plus.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oE7gFclNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southern Made Candles","source_asin":"B0086O906W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0086O906W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0086O906W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":298403,"name":"Party Zones Set of 16pcs Music Themed Balloons Drum Balloons in 12” latex – 2 Sided Print for Birthday Parties or any Occasion, Event – Use Air or Hel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aJSx9NJkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Regardless if it is you who is hosting the party or somebody else’s party, it doesn’t matter - a party is a party and all we want is to have fun and enjoy with everyone else. Everyone just loves to party! But of course, if you are the one who is preparing for the party, we know how much planning is supposed to be done. There are a lot of things we must arrange, buy and coordinate. Most of all, we have to think of the decorations. The decorations will make or break the party vibe, as we all know. Your party / event decorations can always create an atmosphere that will make or break your party. Whatever type of party you are planning, there are a lot of things you can consider for your party décor; but one thing is for certain, one thing is a must, the one tried and tested decoration of all time – BALLOONS. Party Zone’s balloons. Why Party Zone’s balloons? Since the balloons are going to be a major part of the decoration, it is important that you get high-quality ones that won’t be almost translucent once inflated or won’t get “stretchmarks” on the printed design. For those who doesn’t know, stretchmarks are what we call when printed designs break or fade as the latex get stretched when inflated. You can do a lot of things with balloons - hang them on the ceiling with cute little curling ribbons dangling from them, fill them with water and leave them laying around the pool area for your musical themed pool party, fill with helium and tie on your loot bags (our personal favorite!), and put glowsticks inside before inflating for your night outdoor parties, the ideas are endless! Make a balloon arch, tower or balloon wall! Match these drum balloons with Party Zone’s guitar balloons and just make your party a musical festival! Party Zone’s balloons are just the best music decorations for party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aJSx9NJkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PARTY ZONE ET DESSIN","source_asin":"B07R8WLB23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R8WLB23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R8WLB23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
