window.products.push({"id":298424,"name":"ICEBREAKER POP - The Sanitary Ice Tray for Freezer - Disassemble this Ice Cube Tray With Lid for Easy Cleaning - ice cube maker makes 18 ice cubes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eF8mXAvFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a convenient way to ensure a constant supply of ice? Drinks taste so much better when they’re chilled. This is why it’s great to always have ice cubes ready. However, the usual ice trays can be inconvenient to use. Plus, they tend to absorb odors and taste from the other foods in the freezer. The Icebreaker Pop Ice Maker offers a quick and painless way to create and dispense ice cubes. Designed with your convenience in mind, our ice maker is easy to operate. Simply fill it with water, then place it in the freezer. Pulling the straps from both sides instantly gives you eighteen large, ready-to-mix ice cubes. Tired of your ice that vaguely smells or tastes like produce? Or worse, raw meat? Time to get rid of your old tray. Our closed icemaker protects cubes. Create ice that won’t ruin the taste of your beverage. Use this eco-conscious container many times over. Its insulated and watertight design limits melting. The closed container is also easy to take everywhere. Enjoy chilled drinks at the gym, in the office, or while exploring the outdoors. Here are more reasons to love our icemaker: - No spillage, mess-free ice preparation - Patented innovative technology - Reasonably priced - High-quality Danish design - Hygienic method of making ice Choose a convenient way to ensure a constant supply of ice cubes. Add the Icebreaker Pop Ice Maker to your basket TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eF8mXAvFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICEBREAKER","source_asin":"B09G22Q3GG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G22Q3GG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G22Q3GG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
