window.products.push({"id":298792,"name":"Lyfe Simple Natural Acacia Wood Pedestal Stand | Wood Riser with Decorative Beads | Kitchen Counter Decor | Soap Tray for Kitchen Sink | Bathroom Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I4Kf-fSIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a better way of displaying special items? Certain objects in our homes are simply better when displayed prominently. This doesn't just make them easier to find and grab, but also gives them an air of elegance and class. One way of doing this is by putting them on a raised tray or pedestal. With the added height, it's easier to make essentials and ornaments stand out amidst the clutter. Make chosen items shine with this Wood Pedestal Stand with Accessories from Lyfe Simple! This wooden riser is large enough to hold and display various items. Whether that's a decorative candle, your favorite bottle of shampoo, or a succulent plant, this stand will make them pop. Our tray comes with white wooden prayer beads, which you can use as an additional design element to enhance the look of your display. With its rustic appeal, this handmade pedestal is an excellent addition to farmhouse-themed interiors. This charming piece is also a great choice if you want to add a natural touch to modern or contemporary spaces. The stand is finished with a clear, water-protective varnish that highlights the beautiful grain patterns. Please note that since the risers are made from real acacia, there will be slight differences in the color, height, and weight. Every item is truly unique and unlike any other. Aside from being eye-catching, this elevated tray is incredibly durable, thanks to its solid wood construction and expert craftsmanship. It's very stable and comes with 4 non-slip pads that prevent the stand from sliding around your table or countertop. Here are more details about our wood pedestal stand: - Easy to clean - Legs won’t snap or bend easily Take your tabletop decorations to new heights. Add the Lyfe Simple Wood Pedestal Stand with Accessories to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I4Kf-fSIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lyfe Simple","source_asin":"B0BQB8L7QV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQB8L7QV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQB8L7QV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
