window.products.push({"id":298967,"name":"CoTa Global Snowboarding Moose Refrigerator Bobble Magnets Set of 4 - Assorted Color Fun Cute Wild Animal Bobble Head Magnets For Kitchen Fridge, Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mgdEpV06S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE SNOWBOARDING MOOSE BOBBLE MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Bring out the kid in you & display your collection of magnets! Play with the bobble magnets whenever you are bored, stressed or when taking time off. CoTa Global's Snowboarding Moose Bobble Fridge Magnets will surely entertain anyone who sees the cute magnets bobble with just a tap. A must-have magnetic home & office accessory to use as convenient note holders. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home & office ornament for magnet collectors & wild animal lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique decorative bobble magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures, or random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or to post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Includes CoTa Global Assorted Color Set of 4 Snowboarding Moose Bobble Fridge Magnets. The magnets feature colorful moose standing on a snowboard and wearing cool winter clothes. The bobble magnetic decor set features realistic details and colored with vibrant colors making them the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Cute kitchen fridge magnets measure about 4 inches long. HIGH-QUALITY WILD ANIMAL BOBBLE HEAD MAGNETS – Fun magnets for refrigerator are made of premium quality plastic construction, durable springs, and strong magnet attached to the back of each 3D-shaped snowboarding moose figure. The snowboarding moose are connected to durable springs that make them bobble and bounce as you open and close the refrigerator door. Make the magnets shake by gently tapping the beautifully designed Snowboarding Moose. IDEAL USE FOR THE WILD ANIMAL REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboard, cabinet & any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Snowboarding moose magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge and amusing locker decor to help posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos & drawings. Perfect set of functional multi-use magnets for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mgdEpV06S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CoTa Global","source_asin":"B07HMD6JW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-298967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HMD6JW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HMD6JW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
